  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      486.46,
      268.49,
      504.01,
      282.55
    ],
    "text": "EN",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      328.18,
      553.06,
      358.02
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the West-Central Bay of Bengal deep sea areas and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via Trincomalee and Batticaloa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      374.81,
      561.47,
      414.72
    ],
    "text": "The Deep Depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal and adjoining Southwest Bay of Bengal has intensified into a Cyclonic Storm and has been named \u201cAkvan\u201d (pronounced: Akvan).",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      428.54,
      561.4,
      441.48
    ],
    "text": "The system was centred near latitude 12.2\u00b0N and longitude 85.7\u00b0E at around 5.30 p.m. on 16th November",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      447.98,
      561.85,
      460.92
    ],
    "text": "2026.The system is very likely to continue moving north-northwestwards and intensify further into a Severe",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      467.18,
      488.05,
      480.12
    ],
    "text": "Cyclonic Storm over the Westcentral Bay of Bengal around 05.30 p.m. on 17th November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      500.66,
      561.83,
      513.6
    ],
    "text": "Thereafter, it is likely to move northwestwards and further intensify into a Very Severe Cyclonic Storm around",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      519.98,
      561.84,
      532.92
    ],
    "text": "05.30 a.m. on 19th November 2026.Continuing its northwestward movement, the system is likely to cross the",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      539.3,
      561.73,
      552.24
    ],
    "text": "Andhra Pradesh and Yanam coasts between Nellore and Tuni around 11.30 a.m. on 20th November 2026 as a",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      558.65,
      178.85,
      571.59
    ],
    "text": "Very Severe Cyclonic Storm.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      592.13,
      561.82,
      605.07
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      611.45,
      561.85,
      624.39
    ],
    "text": "05N-17N and 80E-90E, and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      630.77,
      561.53,
      643.71
    ],
    "text": "Trincomalee and Batticaloa, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      649.97,
      287.48,
      662.91
    ],
    "text": "those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      677.45,
      561.78,
      690.39
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      696.65,
      254.0,
      709.59
    ],
    "text": "the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
